Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.58,0:00:04.05,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.42,0:00:07.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[deep inhale]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.97,0:00:09.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NCould you stop the camera?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.26,0:00:10.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[CAMERAMAN 22A] Sorry?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.34,0:00:12.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] Stop the camera,\Nor I'll break it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.47,0:00:13.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh!\NNo problem, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.89,0:00:16.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[thumping]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.56,0:00:19.27,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.61,0:00:31.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO]\NHunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.91,0:00:33.62,Default,,0,0,0,,What are you planning\Nto do with Byung-gu?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.45,0:00:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,I asked you a damn question!\NWhat are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.08,0:00:40.58,Default,,0,0,0,,What I have to.\NWe're running out of time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.67,0:00:41.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.83,0:00:43.50,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.29,0:00:45.59,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NArise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.67,0:00:48.17,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.11,0:02:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUGIMOTO REIJI]\NThe chairman has called
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.28,0:02:36.11,Default,,0,0,0,,for the execution of plan nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:36.20,0:02:37.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you ready?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.41,0:02:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Are you insane?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.28,0:02:41.41,Default,,0,0,0,,Sending us back to that island
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.49,0:02:43.45,Default,,0,0,0,,is sending us to our deaths!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.54,0:02:46.21,Default,,0,0,0,,You'd understand if you'd seen\Nthat freak in the flesh!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.29,0:02:48.21,Default,,0,0,0,,He killed Goto-san,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.29,0:02:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,like it was nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.59,0:02:50.71,Default,,0,0,0,,The new ant is dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.80,0:02:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[both gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.88,0:02:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,One of their hunters\Nwas able to take it down.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.76,0:02:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[HOSHINO MINORU]\NThey killed it? Really?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.26,0:02:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUGIMOTO REIJI] Do you\Nstill insist on staying behind?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.35,0:03:01.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[rain splattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.85,0:03:05.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI JONG-IN]\NA skill that lets you raise
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.43,0:03:06.77,Default,,0,0,0,,and command the dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.85,0:03:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,So it wasn't your ordinary\Nsummoning magic, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.65,0:03:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Byung-gu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.98,0:03:12.78,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.28,0:03:16.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NA voice called out to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.95,0:03:18.45,Default,,0,0,0,,It was Hunter Min,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.53,0:03:20.78,Default,,0,0,0,,saying I should\Nuse his power to save her.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.87,0:03:22.70,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.45,0:03:26.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[paper rustling]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.08,0:03:28.00,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.30,0:03:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,I can tell he was\Na remarkable person.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.05,0:03:40.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Healing Hunter Cha\Nwithout even a word from me.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.43,0:03:42.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.35,0:03:43.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] He was\Nthe best of us, wasn't he?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.06,0:03:45.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.89,0:03:47.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[CAMERAMAN 22A]\NI get why he wouldn't want
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.19,0:03:49.02,Default,,0,0,0,,video evidence of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.10,0:03:51.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI JONG-IN] The fiercer the\Nbattle, the stronger he grows.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.36,0:03:54.07,Default,,0,0,0,,What a terrifying ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.15,0:03:56.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[MA DONGWOOK] But now,\Nwhat happens to Byung-gu Min?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.03,0:03:59.20,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO]\NHunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.91,0:04:02.37,Default,,0,0,0,,If you carry on as a hunter,\NI have no doubt
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.45,0:04:04.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Byung-gu's healing magic\Nwill serve you well.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.83,0:04:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.45,0:04:09.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Thing is,\Nhe always hated fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.83,0:04:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He only signed on\Nfor this raid.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:12.46,0:04:15.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Because he believed\Nit would be his final mission.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.76,0:04:17.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Please keep it that way.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.80,0:04:19.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NYou grabbed my shoulder again.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.47,0:04:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.89,0:04:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] Just like back\Nat the red gate incident.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.39,0:04:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,The only difference now,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.22,0:04:26.56,Default,,0,0,0,,is it's not an order,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:26.64,0:04:28.39,Default,,0,0,0,,it's an earnest plea\Nfor your friend.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.64,0:04:30.85,Default,,0,0,0,,You don't have to worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.94,0:04:32.81,Default,,0,0,0,,I was thinking the same thing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.90,0:04:34.90,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.40,0:04:39.15,Default,,0,0,0,,Release extraction.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:39.24,0:04:41.57,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.62,0:04:50.87,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.58,0:04:53.84,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.88,0:04:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[whimpering]
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.05,0:04:59.63,Default,,0,0,0,,[sniffles]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.76,0:05:02.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO]\NThank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.55,0:05:04.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.51,0:05:07.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[MATSUMOTO SHIGEO]\NHow are they still alive?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.43,0:05:08.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUGIMOTO REIJI]\NHunter Sung arrived
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.64,0:05:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,and proceeded\Nto defeat the new variant.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.06,0:05:12.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[MATSUMOTO SHIGEO]\NI can see that, idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.69,0:05:13.98,Default,,0,0,0,,How is he there?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.06,0:05:16.98,Default,,0,0,0,,You said he decided\Nnot to participate in the raid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.07,0:05:18.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUGIMOTO REIJI] Based on\Nthe magic power readings,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.86,0:05:21.45,Default,,0,0,0,,all we can say is\Nhe appeared out of nowhere.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.53,0:05:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[MATSUMOTO SHIGEO]\NThis is a nightmare.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.32,0:05:24.53,Default,,0,0,0,,And on the heels of losing
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.62,0:05:26.58,Default,,0,0,0,,seven of the ten\NS-ranks we sent!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.70,0:05:29.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUGIMOTO REIJI]\NChairman, do you still want us
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.83,0:05:31.83,Default,,0,0,0,,to go through with plan nine?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.91,0:05:34.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Any further casualties\Nwill undercut our ability
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.63,0:05:36.17,Default,,0,0,0,,to respond to domestic gates
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.25,0:05:38.46,Default,,0,0,0,,and could have\Nlasting ramifications
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.55,0:05:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,on the global balance of power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.72,0:05:41.88,Default,,0,0,0,,What's your call?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:42.97,0:05:44.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[MATSUMOTO SHIGEO]\NWe're pulling out.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.51,0:05:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Withdraw immediately.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.76,0:05:48.06,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUGIMOTO REIJI]\NUnderstood, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.14,0:05:49.93,Default,,0,0,0,,[phone beeping]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.02,0:05:51.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:51.10,0:05:52.48,Default,,0,0,0,,[clattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.56,0:05:54.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.73,0:05:56.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:05:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.28,0:06:04.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunts]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.36,0:06:06.37,Default,,0,0,0,,Why are they after us now?\NThey weren't before!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.45,0:06:08.33,Default,,0,0,0,,-[grunts]\N-Do I look like I know?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.41,0:06:10.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I thought the queen\Nwas dead already!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.24,0:06:11.75,Default,,0,0,0,,That's your answer right there!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.83,0:06:12.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[explosions]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.04,0:06:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,With no one to lead them,\Nthey're all over the place!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.92,0:06:18.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Stay sharp!\NThey can't reach the mainland!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.67,0:06:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Ain't gettin' past us!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.05,0:06:21.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Now let's show these bugs\Nwhat the Knights Guild can do!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.92,0:06:23.80,Default,,0,0,0,,You're givin' me strength\Nto keep fighting!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.88,0:06:26.34,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.43,0:06:28.76,Default,,0,0,0,,Hurry!\NThe ants are everywhere!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.85,0:06:30.77,Default,,0,0,0,,[panting]
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.85,0:06:32.85,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.77,0:06:36.77,Default,,0,0,0,,Isn't this a prime shitshow.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.85,0:06:39.02,Default,,0,0,0,,[SEO JIWOO] The ants are going\Nberserk trying to flee,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.11,0:06:41.53,Default,,0,0,0,,and most of them are heading\Nstraight toward the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.61,0:06:44.11,Default,,0,0,0,,We should leave before they\Nblock our route out of here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.20,0:06:45.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I couldn't agree with you more.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.78,0:06:47.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's board and take off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.37,0:06:48.57,Default,,0,0,0,,What about Hunter Sung?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.66,0:06:50.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He told us\Nhe wanted to stay behind
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.24,0:06:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,to take care of the remaining\Nants and eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.79,0:06:54.08,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHOI JONG-IN]\NIt's tough to admit,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.16,0:06:55.92,Default,,0,0,0,,but in our condition,\Nwe'd just slow him down
Dialogue: 0,0:06:56.00,0:06:57.71,Default,,0,0,0,,if we stuck around.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.79,0:07:00.25,Default,,0,0,0,,And while she's no longer\Nin mortal danger,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.34,0:07:02.17,Default,,0,0,0,,we should have the medic team\Nexamine Hunter Cha
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.26,0:07:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,as soon as possible.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.67,0:07:05.72,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.89,0:07:09.89,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.81,0:07:11.97,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.06,0:07:13.14,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NI get experience points
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.22,0:07:14.98,Default,,0,0,0,,for smashing unhatched eggs.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.06,0:07:16.10,Default,,0,0,0,,Lucky me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.19,0:07:17.60,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.69,0:07:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanking]\N[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.02,0:07:22.02,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.11,0:07:23.86,Default,,0,0,0,,[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:29.37,0:07:31.24,Default,,0,0,0,,[rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.99,0:07:34.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NDemon Monarch Sword, heh.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.75,0:07:36.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Damn right it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:36.25,0:07:38.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Feel kinda bad\Nfor not using it earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.71,0:07:40.04,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.13,0:07:41.59,Default,,0,0,0,,Knock yourselves out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.67,0:07:43.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[Iron roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.17,0:07:45.42,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.51,0:07:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[Iron roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.34,0:07:49.18,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.56,0:07:58.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Level 100.\NI've hit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.06,0:08:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,[static]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.65,0:08:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.32,0:08:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NHe may be dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.36,0:08:08.07,Default,,0,0,0,,but I can still feel\Nan immense aura.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.28,0:08:10.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.74,0:08:12.45,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.49,0:08:15.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.37,0:08:19.96,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NWhy is it all dark?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.04,0:08:21.71,Default,,0,0,0,,I can't sense anything.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.79,0:08:24.13,Default,,0,0,0,,Did something happen\Nwith the extraction?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:24.21,0:08:25.71,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.80,0:08:27.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm back.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.43,0:08:31.76,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.22,0:08:37.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.15,0:08:50.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[fire crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.32,0:08:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] Thought I\Nbotched it for a second there.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.79,0:09:03.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Guess we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:03.08,0:09:05.17,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's go wake\Nyour pals up, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:05.25,0:09:07.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[BERU]\NMy king.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:07.13,0:09:08.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.13,0:09:10.72,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NDid you just talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.80,0:09:12.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[BERU]\NYes.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.89,0:09:16.01,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] None of the other\Nshadows talk, so why can he?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.10,0:09:18.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[BERU]\NPlease grant me a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.89,0:09:20.27,Default,,0,0,0,,I beg you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.10,0:09:22.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\N"General" rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.60,0:09:23.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Never seen that before.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.73,0:09:26.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Is speech a perk of this rank?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.07,0:09:29.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Actually, I've got\Na bigger question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:29.94,0:09:31.99,Default,,0,0,0,,You know I was the one\Nwho killed you, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.07,0:09:34.95,Default,,0,0,0,,So, do you still wish\Nto follow my lead?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.03,0:09:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,[BERU]\NI do, for I did not die.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.62,0:09:41.87,Default,,0,0,0,,By your hand, Master,\NI was reborn.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.12,0:09:47.21,Default,,0,0,0,,I am filled with...\Noverwhelming joy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.30,0:09:50.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I swear to serve you\Nfor eternity.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.42,0:09:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,So, please,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:53.38,0:09:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,grant me a name.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.26,0:09:56.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:09:57.35,0:09:58.97,Default,,0,0,0,,[echoing]\NBeru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.27,0:10:02.98,Default,,0,0,0,,The name I grant you is Beru.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:03.06,0:10:05.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I am honored, Master.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:06.06,0:10:07.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NNow, where was I?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.48,0:10:09.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Arise.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:09.98,0:10:11.86,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.28,0:10:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[MALE HUNTER 25A] Guess they\Ngot past the hunters at sea.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.12,0:10:17.99,Default,,0,0,0,,We're the last line of defense!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.08,0:10:19.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop them here or die trying!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.74,0:10:21.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, my God!\NOh, my God! Oh, my God!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:21.29,0:10:23.16,Default,,0,0,0,,How the hell do we\Nfight these things?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.25,0:10:24.67,Default,,0,0,0,,All tanks get in front!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.75,0:10:27.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let them reach\Nthe cities, whatever you do!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.08,0:10:29.00,Default,,0,0,0,,[all screaming]\N[indistinct chatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:31.34,0:10:33.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NThat's a lotta ants.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.17,0:10:36.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[BERU] They cannot organize\Nthemselves without a leader,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:36.55,0:10:38.97,Default,,0,0,0,,so all 4,000 are scattering.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:39.06,0:10:40.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NThere are still that many?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.47,0:10:43.23,Default,,0,0,0,,Can you shave\Nthat number down for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:43.31,0:10:45.31,Default,,0,0,0,,[BERU]\NIf that is your wish, my king,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:45.39,0:10:47.27,Default,,0,0,0,,you need only say the word.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:48.61,0:10:50.19,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NGo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:50.27,0:10:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.40,0:10:55.45,Default,,0,0,0,,[explosion]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.91,0:10:58.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:10:58.87,0:11:00.41,Default,,0,0,0,,All right, nice job!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.49,0:11:01.70,Default,,0,0,0,,These things are dangerous!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.79,0:11:04.25,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't be a hero,\Njust take down one at a time!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.33,0:11:05.96,Default,,0,0,0,,If everyone works together,\Nwe can survive this!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.04,0:11:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Song!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:07.88,0:11:09.54,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:12.92,0:11:14.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[LEE JOOHEE]\NAre you okay? What happened?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:14.84,0:11:16.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I'm not really sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.26,0:11:18.05,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.85,0:11:23.39,Default,,0,0,0,,[LEE JOOHEE]\NThat blue light.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.47,0:11:25.35,Default,,0,0,0,,[SONG CHIYUL]\NI could be wrong, but...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:25.43,0:11:27.56,Default,,0,0,0,,I think that light saved us.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:28.56,0:11:30.11,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinwoo must've sent it.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:30.19,0:11:32.65,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.73,0:11:34.49,Default,,0,0,0,,[LIM TAE-GYU]\NThere are too damn many!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.57,0:11:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Why aren't you\Nlighting them up?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:35.99,0:11:38.11,Default,,0,0,0,,If I did,\NI'd wreck the helicopter!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.20,0:11:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:39.28,0:11:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,[creaking]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.33,0:11:43.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the worst.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.83,0:11:46.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Not a lot we can do\Nto help in midair.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.08,0:11:47.79,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.87,0:11:49.38,Default,,0,0,0,,[grunting]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:50.33,0:11:52.00,Default,,0,0,0,,-[cracking]\N-[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:52.09,0:11:53.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[shattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.17,0:11:54.17,Default,,0,0,0,,[all gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:54.26,0:11:55.76,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:11:57.09,0:11:58.55,Default,,0,0,0,,[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.63,0:12:00.64,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:02.51,0:12:03.56,Default,,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:03.64,0:12:05.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO] We were\Nsaved twice in one day,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.77,0:12:07.06,Default,,0,0,0,,by the same man.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.14,0:12:09.02,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:12:11.86,0:12:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They should be able\Nto make it back now.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.73,0:12:16.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[crowd cheering]
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.11,0:12:17.57,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE]\NAnd so...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:17.65,0:12:20.74,Default,,0,0,0,,the ants that managed to break\Nthrough the island's perimeter
Dialogue: 0,0:12:20.82,0:12:23.33,Default,,0,0,0,,were held off by the scores\Nof brave hunters
Dialogue: 0,0:12:23.41,0:12:24.95,Default,,0,0,0,,standing guard in the field,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:27.62,Default,,0,0,0,,their efforts significantly\Nminimizing the damage
Dialogue: 0,0:12:27.71,0:12:29.25,Default,,0,0,0,,to the mainland.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.33,0:12:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,All but one of our country's\NS-ranks returned to us.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:32.63,0:12:35.51,Default,,0,0,0,,And, Hunter Cha,\Nwho remained unconscious,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.59,0:12:37.63,Default,,0,0,0,,was safely transported\Nto a hospital.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.67,0:12:40.38,Default,,0,0,0,,It was a hard-fought battle
Dialogue: 0,0:12:40.47,0:12:42.68,Default,,0,0,0,,and not everyone\Nwalked away from it.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.76,0:12:45.64,Default,,0,0,0,,But despite the casualties,\Nthe emergent threat
Dialogue: 0,0:12:45.72,0:12:48.35,Default,,0,0,0,,from the island\Nwas successfully neutralized.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.27,0:12:52.65,Default,,0,0,0,,The fourth Jeju Island raid\Nto clear the dungeon break,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.73,0:12:54.57,Default,,0,0,0,,ended in our victory.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.36,0:13:00.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[COMMANDER 25A] We've got\Nmore visitors from far abroad.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.74,0:13:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,That's two days straight now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.87,0:13:05.12,Default,,0,0,0,,They're just about\Nwithin firing range.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.20,0:13:07.12,Default,,0,0,0,,[CREW 25A] Jianzhang, I'll\Nnotify the mages on standby.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:07.20,0:13:09.16,Default,,0,0,0,,Preparing to intercept\Nthe incoming ants!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:09.25,0:13:11.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-Sailors, man your stations!\N-Belay that order.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.54,0:13:13.04,Default,,0,0,0,,[COMMANDER 25A]\NIt seems China's hero wants
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.13,0:13:14.71,Default,,0,0,0,,a little bit of exercise.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.88,0:13:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[Liu Zhigang sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.96,0:13:18.76,Default,,0,0,0,,[LIU ZHIGANG]\NCan't sit around all day.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:18.84,0:13:20.34,Default,,0,0,0,,And here they come.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.26,0:13:24.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Hao ba, let's send some\Nvermin to a watery grave.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:28.81,0:13:29.81,Default,,0,0,0,,[inhales deeply]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.89,0:13:31.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[growls]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.90,0:13:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,[explosions]
Dialogue: 0,0:13:41.61,0:13:43.57,Default,,0,0,0,,If I'd gotten a crack\Nat the black ant
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.66,0:13:46.12,Default,,0,0,0,,instead of that\NJeen-whatever guy,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.20,0:13:48.16,Default,,0,0,0,,might've actually had some fun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.24,0:13:49.45,Default,,0,0,0,,A shame.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:50.37,0:13:51.83,Default,,0,0,0,,[ANNOUNCER 25A]\NSeveral days have passed
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.91,0:13:54.29,Default,,0,0,0,,since the successful\NJeju Island raid,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.38,0:13:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,and a memorial has been erected\Nin honor of the lives lost,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.50,0:14:00.26,Default,,0,0,0,,with a large crowd\Ncoming to pay their respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.63,0:14:03.59,Default,,0,0,0,,And here we see S-rank hunter,\NJinwoo Sung,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:03.68,0:14:04.84,Default,,0,0,0,,approaching the monument.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.93,0:14:07.89,Default,,0,0,0,,His contributions to the raid\Nwere immense to say the least,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.97,0:14:11.73,Default,,0,0,0,,and it's arguable that we would\Nnot have succeeded without him.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.69,0:14:14.44,Default,,0,0,0,,Some are calling him a hero...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.52,0:14:15.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[FEMALE 25A]\NBut at the same time,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.52,0:14:17.73,Default,,0,0,0,,there are more\Ncritical voices asking
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.82,0:14:19.94,Default,,0,0,0,,whether there would\Nhave been fewer casualties
Dialogue: 0,0:14:20.03,0:14:22.07,Default,,0,0,0,,had Hunter Sung\Nagreed to participate
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.15,0:14:24.07,Default,,0,0,0,,from the very beginning.\N[footfall]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.16,0:14:25.99,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:28.62,0:14:30.58,Default,,0,0,0,,[BAEK YOONHO]\NPlease hold your head high.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.66,0:14:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,No matter\Nwhat the public thinks,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.62,0:14:34.96,Default,,0,0,0,,the one who ended\Nthis tragedy...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:35.04,0:14:36.54,Default,,0,0,0,,was you, Hunter Sung.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.63,0:14:38.38,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:14:43.30,0:14:44.51,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.89,0:14:49.01,Default,,0,0,0,,Hm?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.06,0:14:53.89,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt anything I say\Ncould express my sincere
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.98,0:14:55.52,Default,,0,0,0,,and unwavering gratitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:56.35,0:14:59.77,Default,,0,0,0,,But still, please allow me\Nto thank you for your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.86,0:15:00.90,Default,,0,0,0,,No, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.98,0:15:03.53,Default,,0,0,0,,If I had just left\Nfor the raid a bit sooner,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.61,0:15:06.53,Default,,0,0,0,,then maybe I could've\Nsaved Hunter Min.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.61,0:15:08.87,Default,,0,0,0,,You did save\Nfive other S-ranks, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:08.95,0:15:10.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Not to mention\Nthe remaining defenders
Dialogue: 0,0:15:10.95,0:15:12.37,Default,,0,0,0,,and the citizens\Nwho would have died
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.45,0:15:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,had they fallen.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:13.75,0:15:15.41,Default,,0,0,0,,You should be proud,\Nnot ashamed.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.12,0:15:18.17,Default,,0,0,0,,I give you my word\Nthat you will be rewarded
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.25,0:15:20.80,Default,,0,0,0,,however you wish...\Nin due time.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:21.75,0:15:23.46,Default,,0,0,0,,-I appreciate it.\N-Hm.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:25.09,0:15:26.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE]\NNow, I was wondering,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.76,0:15:28.93,Default,,0,0,0,,about your plans\Nfor the future.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:29.01,0:15:31.93,Default,,0,0,0,,-[SUNG JINWOO] The future, sir?\N-[GO GUNHEE] Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:32.01,0:15:33.56,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE]\NThanks to this raid,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.64,0:15:35.23,Default,,0,0,0,,your power\Nhas been demonstrated
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.31,0:15:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,on an international level.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.02,0:15:40.11,Default,,0,0,0,,I doubt the public will\Nleave you alone anytime soon.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.19,0:15:42.48,Default,,0,0,0,,And what\Nthe Association can't ignore
Dialogue: 0,0:15:42.57,0:15:44.86,Default,,0,0,0,,is that you'll be approached\Nby all sorts of people
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.94,0:15:46.95,Default,,0,0,0,,with various motives.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.03,0:15:49.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Which is why I feel\Nthe need to ask you.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.70,0:15:52.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Hunter Sung,\Njust what will you do
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.37,0:15:54.04,Default,,0,0,0,,with all the power you wield?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.12,0:15:56.75,Default,,0,0,0,,When you fight,\Nwhose battles will they be?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.83,0:15:58.29,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:16:02.25,0:16:05.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been thinking about\Nstarting up a guild of my own.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.76,0:16:10.80,Default,,0,0,0,,[JUNG YOONTAE] How the hell did\Nwe get stuck with cleanup duty
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.89,0:16:12.97,Default,,0,0,0,,on the day of the\Nmemorial ceremony?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.06,0:16:16.39,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, dumbass, maybe because\Nthis is important stuff, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:16.48,0:16:17.89,Default,,0,0,0,,Someone's gotta\Nkill the stragglers
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.98,0:16:19.44,Default,,0,0,0,,and collect the resources.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.52,0:16:21.61,Default,,0,0,0,,And gettin' delegated\Nto tie up the loose ends
Dialogue: 0,0:16:21.69,0:16:23.36,Default,,0,0,0,,shows they trust me.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.44,0:16:24.44,Default,,0,0,0,,[JUNG YOONTAE]\NBut...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:24.53,0:16:26.07,Default,,0,0,0,,But nothin', kid.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.15,0:16:27.82,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword slashing]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:27.90,0:16:28.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[thuds]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:28.99,0:16:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,A real man does the job\Nhe's given, nice and smooth.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:31.87,0:16:34.37,Default,,0,0,0,,And he doesn't bitch about\Ndoin' it either.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:34.45,0:16:36.04,Default,,0,0,0,,You are so awesome!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.12,0:16:37.29,Default,,0,0,0,,[all gasp]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:38.71,0:16:39.87,Default,,0,0,0,,Hold it!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.96,0:16:42.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Jeju Island\Nis off-limits to civilians!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.46,0:16:45.96,Default,,0,0,0,,-Identify yourself!\N-[speaking foreign language]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.05,0:16:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]\NLook.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.34,0:16:48.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Whoever you are.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.47,0:16:50.59,Default,,0,0,0,,This ain't an open invitation,\Nyou're not supposed to--
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.68,0:16:54.10,Default,,0,0,0,,[heart thumping]\N[thudding]
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.47,0:16:56.85,Default,,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:56.93,0:16:59.19,Default,,0,0,0,,I just had them\Ntake a little nap.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.27,0:17:01.40,Default,,0,0,0,,All that noise\Nwas bothering me.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:01.48,0:17:04.23,Default,,0,0,0,,In any case,\Nwas it him we sensed?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.32,0:17:06.36,Default,,0,0,0,,[MAN 25A] Yeah,\Nit was definitely his power.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:06.44,0:17:07.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[OLD MAN 25A]\NI don't know why he'd willingly
Dialogue: 0,0:17:08.03,0:17:09.86,Default,,0,0,0,,lend that power to humans.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.95,0:17:11.28,Default,,0,0,0,,It's very strange.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:11.36,0:17:12.91,Default,,0,0,0,,[MAN 25A]\NHis behavior is nothing new,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.99,0:17:14.24,Default,,0,0,0,,but if you're curious.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.33,0:17:15.83,Default,,0,0,0,,You could just\Nask him yourself.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.91,0:17:17.79,Default,,0,0,0,,If given the chance perhaps.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.62,0:17:20.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[snaps fingers]\NWe got one answer at least.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.71,0:17:22.33,Default,,0,0,0,,[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:22.42,0:17:24.79,Default,,0,0,0,,Let us return\Nwith this knowledge.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.88,0:17:27.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[MAN 25A]\NWait, isn't one of them here?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.17,0:17:30.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[OLD MAN 25A] I think this area\Nwould be best left to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.51,0:17:33.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[MAN 25A] In other words,\Nyou don't want to get involved.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:33.39,0:17:35.81,Default,,0,0,0,,The hunt will commence\Nas we planned it.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:35.89,0:17:37.31,Default,,0,0,0,,That hasn't changed.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.69,0:17:45.11,Default,,0,0,0,,[exhales]
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.94,0:17:46.94,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:47.02,0:17:49.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I guess it really isn't worth\Nthe extra trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:49.78,0:17:51.07,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:17:51.15,0:17:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,[MAN 25A]\NQuite the stench, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:52.82,0:17:55.37,Default,,0,0,0,,She'd be less than pleased\Nif she caught a whiff of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:03.75,0:18:05.59,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:06.71,0:18:08.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NTraffic sucks.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:10.09,0:18:12.84,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOO JINHO] Did you, uh,\Nask about the guild?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:12.93,0:18:15.85,Default,,0,0,0,,Yeah, Chairman Go gave us\Nhis approval, so we're good.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:15.93,0:18:17.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Wow!\NJust like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:17.26,0:18:19.31,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll get straight to work\Nfinding us an office, then!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.39,0:18:21.23,Default,,0,0,0,,-[HAN SONG-YI] A guild?\N-Excuse you!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:21.31,0:18:23.81,Default,,0,0,0,,Jinwoo, you have to promise\Nthat you'll hire me, okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.90,0:18:25.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I'll be a devoted guildmate!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.98,0:18:27.69,Default,,0,0,0,,[YOO JINHO] This is an\Nimportant business discussion!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:27.77,0:18:29.65,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NOkay, okay, bye, hanging up.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.53,0:18:32.32,Default,,0,0,0,,[scoffs]\NThose two.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:32.40,0:18:33.74,Default,,0,0,0,,For real though,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.82,0:18:35.53,Default,,0,0,0,,the hell's going on\Nwith this traffic?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:35.62,0:18:36.78,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:18:36.87,0:18:38.66,Default,,0,0,0,,[phone vibrating]
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.74,0:18:39.95,Default,,0,0,0,,Hello?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.04,0:18:42.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE]\NHunter Sung. It's Chairman Go.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.29,0:18:44.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Was there a problem\Nwith the guild, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.58,0:18:46.75,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE]\NNo, I'm calling about a gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.71,0:18:49.42,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO] You said\Nit's down this highway?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:49.50,0:18:51.21,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE] It's a B-rank\Nbut it'll be a while
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.30,0:18:52.80,Default,,0,0,0,,before our hunters\Ncan get there.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.88,0:18:54.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NUgh, but I can't go without
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.13,0:18:55.80,Default,,0,0,0,,the Association's permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:55.89,0:18:57.18,Default,,0,0,0,,[GO GUNHEE]\NHaha, who do you think
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.26,0:18:58.72,Default,,0,0,0,,you're speaking to right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.80,0:19:00.68,Default,,0,0,0,,The big man in charge.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.77,0:19:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,[indistinct chatter]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.77,0:19:02.60,Default,,0,0,0,,[WORKER 25A]\NOne vehicle at a time, please!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:02.68,0:19:03.89,Default,,0,0,0,,The association\Nneeds to fix this stat.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.98,0:19:05.27,Default,,0,0,0,,[MOTORIST 25A]\NWhere are the hunters at?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:06.15,0:19:08.77,Default,,0,0,0,,What? The hunters are caught\Nin all this traffic, too?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.86,0:19:10.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Then, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.27,0:19:11.69,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, did you just...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.78,0:19:14.03,Default,,0,0,0,,Rude.\NAh?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.11,0:19:15.45,Default,,0,0,0,,Hey, I'm here\Nto close the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:15.53,0:19:17.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Right, Manager Woo just told me
Dialogue: 0,0:19:17.28,0:19:19.62,Default,,0,0,0,,but, you're the only hunter\Nwho's arrived so far,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.70,0:19:21.49,Default,,0,0,0,,and it might be a minute\Nbefore the other ones show up--
Dialogue: 0,0:19:21.58,0:19:24.04,Default,,0,0,0,,-Let me solo it.\N-Sir! Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:26.00,0:19:27.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I know it's only B-rank,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:28.00,0:19:30.21,Default,,0,0,0,,but it is still risky\Nto go alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:30.80,0:19:31.88,Default,,0,0,0,,[gasps]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.96,0:19:34.05,Default,,0,0,0,,[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.13,0:19:35.42,Default,,0,0,0,,It's a red gate!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.84,0:19:38.09,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NYep.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:38.18,0:19:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,This is a red gate.\N[rain splattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.18,0:19:43.72,Default,,0,0,0,,I don't understand\Nhow this keeps happening to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.81,0:19:45.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The exit's closed\Ntill I beat the boss,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:45.60,0:19:47.81,Default,,0,0,0,,and I have no clue\Nhow far this forest goes.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:47.90,0:19:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,[sighs]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:48.98,0:19:51.19,Default,,0,0,0,,Should've called Mom\Nto tell her I was gonna be late
Dialogue: 0,0:19:51.27,0:19:52.69,Default,,0,0,0,,before coming in here.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.44,0:19:55.95,Default,,0,0,0,,[growling]
Dialogue: 0,0:19:56.03,0:19:59.91,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, if this is all there is,\Nit won't take long.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.78,0:20:02.03,Default,,0,0,0,,[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.12,0:20:04.70,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:04.79,0:20:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.71,0:20:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:10.42,0:20:11.92,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:12.00,0:20:13.67,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.92,0:20:18.43,Default,,0,0,0,,[electricity crackling]
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.51,0:20:20.26,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.51,0:20:25.47,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, let's try\Nto make this quick.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.56,0:20:27.81,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.27,0:20:34.98,Default,,0,0,0,,I saw he came to the service.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.94,0:20:36.94,Default,,0,0,0,,[CHA HAE-IN]\NThis raid proved
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.03,0:20:38.91,Default,,0,0,0,,that I still have\Na lot to learn.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.99,0:20:41.16,Default,,0,0,0,,I was no help in the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.24,0:20:42.83,Default,,0,0,0,,My mission was\Nto save our country
Dialogue: 0,0:20:42.91,0:20:44.99,Default,,0,0,0,,and I had to be saved.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.45,0:20:48.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But, not him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.21,0:20:50.63,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to catch up to him.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.71,0:20:52.67,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.75,0:20:55.05,Default,,0,0,0,,I want to stand at his side.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.13,0:20:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And to do that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.47,0:21:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,I need to get stronger.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.05,0:21:02.30,Default,,0,0,0,,[sword clanking]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.26,0:21:07.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NHunters are born to hunt,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:07.93,0:21:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,and in dungeons where survival\Nis far from guaranteed,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:11.19,0:21:13.69,Default,,0,0,0,,they have to be prepared\Nto become the prey.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.07,0:21:18.19,Default,,0,0,0,,See, the tides can change\Nat any given moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.28,0:21:19.86,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:19.95,0:21:22.37,Default,,0,0,0,,They're always one wrong move\Naway from death,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:22.45,0:21:24.45,Default,,0,0,0,,but never willing to back down.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.74,0:21:27.33,Default,,0,0,0,,Doesn't matter how strong,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.41,0:21:29.29,Default,,0,0,0,,or how numerous the enemies.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:29.37,0:21:30.92,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:31.96,0:21:34.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Because they've all got\Nsomething to fight for.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.96,0:21:36.84,Default,,0,0,0,,To protect their family.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.92,0:21:39.05,Default,,0,0,0,,To uphold their ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.13,0:21:40.63,Default,,0,0,0,,To prove who they are.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:40.72,0:21:42.22,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:21:42.30,0:21:44.64,Default,,0,0,0,,To defy fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.72,0:21:45.85,Default,,0,0,0,,[roaring]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.93,0:21:48.47,Default,,0,0,0,,[SUNG JINWOO]\NHunters will continue to hunt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:49.64,0:21:51.77,Default,,0,0,0,,And not a single one
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.85,0:21:53.60,Default,,0,0,0,,is ready to stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:55.27,0:21:56.98,Default,,0,0,0,,[footfall]
Dialogue: 0,0:21:57.98,0:21:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,[rain splattering]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.74,0:22:07.62,Default,,0,0,0,,[thunder rumbling]
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.16,0:22:14.33,Default,,0,0,0,,♪
Dialogue: 0,0:22:14.42,0:22:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's move on\Nto the next target.
